041702             0376*   ; delay routine
041702             0377*   ; Author: Richard Turrnidge
041702             0378*   ; https://github.com/richardturnnidge/lessons/blob/main/slowdown.inc
041702             0379*   ; routine waits a fixed time,then returns
041702             0380*   ; arrive with A =  the delay byte. One bit to be set only.
041702             0381*   ; eg. ld A,00000100b
041702             0382*   
041702             0383*   multiPurposeDelay:
       FF FF FF 
041702 F5          0384*       push af
041703 C5          0385*       push bc
041704 DD E5       0386*       push ix
041706 47          0387*       ld b,a
